Title: QUANTUM VAULT
Author: Morgan Thorne

EXT. HIGH PLAINS RESEARCH FACILITY - DUSK

Wind whips through the security fences. A sleek armored transport stops at the perimeter gate.

GUARD
State your authorization code.

MARCUS
(leaning out window)
Courier dispatch 4-Echo-Zulu.

GUARD
Clear. Proceed to loading dock B.

INT. LOADING DOCK B - NIGHT

Marcus steps down from the cabin with a secure biometric case.

MARCUS
Target acquired. Moving to containment.
